### Count employees by department
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/employees-by-department
Accept: application/json

###
### Count employees by position
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/employees-by-position
Accept: application/json

###
### Get monthly attendance statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/monthly-attendance?month=2026-04
Accept: application/json

###
### Get dashboard statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/dashboard?month=2026-04
Accept: application/json

###
### Export monthly attendance CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/monthly-attendance.csv?month=2026-04
Accept: text/csv
